{"headword":"אוֹר²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר</span></big><sub>121</sub> <strong>f.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 36:32\" href=\"/Job.36.32\">Jb 36:32</a></sup>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.16\">Je 13:16</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:3\" href=\"/Genesis.1.3\">Gn 1:3</a> <strong>light (</strong>Assyrian <em>urru</em> = <em>ûru</em> Dl<sup>W</sup><strong>)</strong>—abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:3\" href=\"/Genesis.1.3\">Gn 1:3</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:2\" href=\"/Judges.16.2\">Ju 16:2</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:1\" href=\"/Psalms.27.1\">ψ 27:1</a>, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:7\" href=\"/Psalms.136.7\">ψ 136:7</a>;—<br/>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>light</em> as diffused in nature, light of day <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:3\" href=\"/Genesis.1.3\">Gn 1:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:4\" href=\"/Genesis.1.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:5\" href=\"/Genesis.1.5\">5</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Job 3:9\" href=\"/Job.3.9\">Jb 3:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 38:19\" href=\"/Job.38.19\">38:19</a> +.<br/>"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>morning light, dawn</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר הַבֹּקֶר</span> light of the morn. <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:2\" href=\"/Judges.16.2\">Ju 16:2</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.36\">1 S 14:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:34\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.34\">25:34</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.36\">36</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.22\">2 S 17:22</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.9\">2 K 7:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 2:1\" href=\"/Micah.2.1\">Mi 2:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ בֹּקֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.4\">2 S 23:4</a> (poem of David); <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:26\" href=\"/Judges.19.26\">Ju 19:26</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־הַבֹּקֶר</span> v <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:25\" href=\"/Judges.19.25\">25</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">לָאוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:14\" href=\"/Job.24.14\">Jb 24:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־הָאוֹר עַד מַחֲצִית הַיּוֹם</span> from <em>dawn till mid-day</em>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.3\">Ne 8:3</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.18\">Pr 4:18</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>light</em> of the heavenly luminaries; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַלְּבָנָה</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ הַחַמָּה</span> <em>moonlight</em> & <em>sunlight</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.26\">Is 30:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוֹכְבֵי אוֹר</span> <em>stars of light</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 148:3\" href=\"/Psalms.148.3\">ψ 148:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹרֵי אוֹר</span> <em>luminaries of light</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.8\">Ez 32:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹרִים</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאוֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 136:7\" href=\"/Psalms.136.7\">ψ 136:7</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲלֵי־אוֹר</span> <em>in sunshine</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.4\">Is 18:4</a>; the sun itself <a data-ref=\"Job 31:26\" href=\"/Job.31.26\">Jb 31:26</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>daylight</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר רְשָׁעִים</span> <em>light of the wicked</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:15\" href=\"/Job.38.15\">Jb 38:15</a> (their work-day being the night); <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם אוֹר</span> <em>a day of light</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:9\" href=\"/Amos.8.9\">Am 8:9</a> (= a clear, sunshiny day).<br/>"}],"num":"4."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>lightning</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:32\" href=\"/Job.36.32\">Jb 36:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 37:3\" href=\"/Job.37.3\">37:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 37:11\" href=\"/Job.37.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 37:15\" href=\"/Job.37.15\">15</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:11\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.11\">Hb 3:11</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"5."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>light</em> of lamp <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.9\">Pr 13:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.10\">Je 25:10</a>; of crocodile’s hot breath <a data-ref=\"Job 41:10\" href=\"/Job.41.10\">Jb 41:10</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"6."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>light of life</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ חַיִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:30\" href=\"/Job.33.30\">Jb 33:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 56:14\" href=\"/Psalms.56.14\">ψ 56:14</a>; cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אוֹר²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אוֹר²\">אוֹר</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:16\" href=\"/Job.3.16\">Jb 3:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 3:20\" href=\"/Job.3.20\">20</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"7."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>light of prosperity</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:28\" href=\"/Job.22.28\">Jb 22:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:26\" href=\"/Job.30.26\">30:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 97:11\" href=\"/Psalms.97.11\">ψ 97:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.2\">La 3:2</a>.<br/>"}],"num":"8."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>light of instruction</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵר מִצְוָה וְתוֹרָה אוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.23\">Pr 6:23</a> <em>the commandment</em> is <em>a lamp and instruction a light;</em> so the Messian. servant is <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר גּוֹיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.6\">Is 42:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.6\">49:6</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ עַמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.4\">Is 51:4</a>; the advent of Mess. is shining of great light <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.1\">Is 9:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>."}],"num":"9."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>light</em> of face <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹר פָּנִים</span> = bright, cheerful face (of men) <a data-ref=\"Job 29:24\" href=\"/Job.29.24\">Jb 29:24</a>; betokening king’s favour <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.15\">Pr 16:15</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֵינַ֫יִם\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵינַ֫יִם\", dir=\"rtl\">א׳ עֵינַיִם</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:11\" href=\"/Psalms.38.11\">ψ 38:11</a>); of God = his shining, enlightening, favouring face <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:7\" href=\"/Psalms.4.7\">ψ 4:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:4\" href=\"/Psalms.44.4\">44:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:16\" href=\"/Psalms.89.16\">89:16</a>."}],"num":"10."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Yahweh is <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ יִשְׂרָאֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.17\">Is 10:17</a>, as source of enlightenment & prosperity; light & salvation <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:1\" href=\"/Psalms.27.1\">ψ 27:1</a>; light to guide <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:8\" href=\"/Micah.7.8\">Mi 7:8</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 43:3\" href=\"/Psalms.43.3\">ψ 43:3</a>; everlasting light of Zion, instead of sun & moon <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.19\">Is 60:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.20\">20</a>; house of Jacob is to walk in his light <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.5\">Is 2:5</a>."}],"num":"11."}]},"rid":"BDB00262","strong_numbers":["215","216"],"next_hw":"אוֹרָה","prev_hw":"אוֹר","occurrences":"121","quotes":[],"GK":["239","240"],"TWOT":["52","52a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}